  "releaseNotes": "### Added\n\n- Import NativeAOT MSTAT, scan DGML, and map XML artifacts into SQLite.\n- Report summary, member, and dominator data as tables, JSON, or CSV.\n- Generate a linked, self-contained HTML report.\n- Package NativeAOT tools for Windows, Linux, and macOS.\n- Build and publish RID packages through GitHub Actions and NuGet trusted publishing.\n- Derive the package version and release notes from this changelog.\n- Use the SQLite library supplied by each operating system.",
